{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41585","headline":"洪州解至长安初举纳省卷梦仙谣 · 沈彬","name":"洪州解至长安初举纳省卷梦仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n玉殿大开从客入，金桃烂熟没人偷。\n凤惊宝扇频翻翅，龙惧金鞭不转头。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}